  return res.status(401).json({ error: 'Token expired' });
}
```

Use `>=`: token invalid when current time reaches `exp`.

Do not use `jwt.decode()` for authentication. It does not verify signature. Use `jwt.verify()` without `ignoreExpiration: true`.

